nDPI fingerprint check (TEST -> DETAILS -> "DPI fingerprint")

  upstream   https://github.com/ntop/nDPI  tag 6.0, commit 1a5293396337f9a72dfee1fa070b2c4b0a0a3aaf
  licence    LGPL-3.0 (LICENSE-nDPI, copied by scripts/build-ndpi.sh);
             some dissectors are dual-licensed by ntop (README.license.md).
  mode       NDPI_LICENSE_FOR_PROFIT_LGPL: only LGPL components run; the
             dual-licensed TLS, QUIC, DNS and DHCP dissectors are not loaded,
             so TLS-based profiles are matched by port only.
  build      scripts/build-ndpi.sh: static libndpi.a per ABI (NDK clang,
             16 KB page alignment) linked into native/ndpi-classify/classify.c
             (GPL-3.0) as the executable libndpiclassify.so.
  relinking  the pinned source, the script and classify.c rebuild and relink
             it; no modified nDPI code is used.
  size       ~3.5 MB per ABI stripped (x86-64 measurement), ~0.9 MB compressed.
  use        diagnostic only, never in the connection path: one engine test is
             recorded by `ghajar-helper dpirelay` and classified offline.
